{"id":"u96","kelas":"pron","no":5,"judul":"Ejaan yang Menipu","title":"Spelling Surprises","emoji":"🔇","ringkas":"Huruf diam, gh, ough, c dan g lunak, serta kata yang dibaca tak sesuai tulisan","ready":true,"goals":["mengenali **huruf diam** (knife, listen, climb, island)","membaca kelompok **-ough, gh, ea, oo** yang berbeda-beda","membaca **c dan g lunak** (city, giant) dan **ch** (church, school, chef)","membedakan kata yang **berbunyi sama tetapi berbeda ejaan** (write dan right)"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Ejaan bahasa Inggris tidak selalu cocok dengan bunyinya. Banyak huruf yang ditulis tetapi tidak dibaca, dan satu kelompok huruf bisa dibaca dengan beberapa cara. Unit ini membahas pola yang paling sering menipu. Menghafal pola lebih cepat daripada menebak setiap kata."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Huruf diam (silent letters)","table":[["Huruf diam","Contoh"],["**k** sebelum n","[[knife]], [[know]], [[knee]], [[knock]]"],["**w** sebelum r","[[write]], [[wrong]], [[wrap]], [[wrist]]"],["**b** setelah m","[[climb]], [[comb]], [[lamb]], [[thumb]]; juga [[doubt]]"],["**l** sebelum k atau m","[[walk]], [[talk]], [[half]], [[calm]]"],["**t** di tengah","[[listen]], [[castle]], [[often]] (kadang)"],["**gh** / **g** sebelum n","[[night]], [[light]], [[sign]], [[foreign]]"],["**h** di awal","[[hour]], [[honest]], [[heir]]"],["**s** pada island","[[island]], [[aisle]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[I know he wrote the wrong answer.]]","id":"Aku tahu dia menulis jawaban yang salah."},{"en":"[[We listen to the radio every night.]]","id":"Kami mendengarkan radio setiap malam."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Kelompok -ough: satu ejaan, banyak bunyi","table":[["Ejaan","Bunyi","Contoh"],["**-ough**","/oʊ/ seperti go","[[though]], [[dough]]"],["**-ough**","/u/ seperti blue","[[through]]"],["**-ough**","/ʌf/ seperti cuff","[[tough]], [[enough]], [[rough]]"],["**-ough**","/ɔf/ seperti off","[[cough]]"],["**-ought**","/ɔt/ seperti caught","[[thought]], [[bought]], [[brought]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. c dan g lunak, ch, dan kelompok vokal","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["**c** + e, i, y dibaca /s/","[[city]], [[centre]], [[cycle]]; **c** + a, o, u dibaca /k/: [[cat]], [[cold]], [[cup]]"],["**g** + e, i, y sering /dʒ/","[[giant]], [[general]], [[gym]]; pengecualian: [[give]], [[get]], [[girl]]"],["**ch**","/tʃ/: [[church]], [[cheese]]; /k/: [[school]], [[chemistry]]; /ʃ/: [[chef]], [[machine]]"],["**ea**","/i/: [[eat]], [[sea]]; /ɛ/: [[bread]], [[head]]; /eɪ/: [[great]], [[steak]]"],["**oo**","/u/: [[food]], [[moon]]; /ʊ/: [[book]], [[good]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Kata yang berbunyi sama (homophone)","text":"Ada kata yang dibaca sama tetapi ditulis dan berarti berbeda. Konteks kalimat menentukan ejaannya.","table":[["Bunyi sama","Contoh"],["write – right","[[Write your name.]] / [[Turn right.]]"],["see – sea","[[I see a boat.]] / [[The sea is blue.]]"],["hear – here","[[I can hear you.]] / [[Come here.]]"],["buy – by","[[I buy bread.]] / [[Sit by the window.]]"],["son – sun","[[He is my son.]] / [[The sun is hot.]]"],["meet – meat","[[Nice to meet you.]] / [[I do not eat meat.]]"],["week – weak","[[It is a long week.]] / [[I feel weak.]]"],["hour – our","[[One hour left.]] / [[It is our house.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara belajar ejaan","text":"Kelompokkan kata menurut **pola**, misalnya semua kata dengan kn- (knife, know, knee). Satu pola membuka puluhan kata. Gunakan 🔊 untuk memeriksa bunyinya."},{"t":"summary","items":["Huruf diam: [[knife]], [[write]], [[climb]], [[walk]], [[listen]], [[hour]].","-ough: [[though]], [[through]], [[tough]], [[cough]], [[thought]].","c dan g lunak sebelum e, i, y: [[city]], [[giant]].","Homophone: [[write]] / [[right]], [[see]] / [[sea]], [[hour]] / [[our]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"knife\"?","options":["k","n","f","e"],"answer":0,"exp":"Knife dibaca /naɪf/.","k":"32a6a543"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"write\"?","options":["w","r","t","e"],"answer":0,"exp":"Write dibaca /raɪt/.","k":"ceebaa2c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"climb\"?","options":["b","c","l","m"],"answer":0,"exp":"Climb dibaca /klaɪm/.","k":"804ff877"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"walk\"?","options":["l","w","a","k"],"answer":0,"exp":"Walk dibaca /wɔk/.","k":"01ac5320"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"listen\"?","options":["t","l","n","s"],"answer":0,"exp":"Listen dibaca /ˈlɪsən/.","k":"de2c3a92"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"hour\"?","options":["h","o","u","r"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hour dibaca /aʊr/.","k":"3a33d0f3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"island\"?","options":["s","i","l","d"],"answer":0,"exp":"Island dibaca /ˈaɪlənd/.","k":"17faace9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"night\"?","options":["gh","n","i","t"],"answer":0,"exp":"Night dibaca /naɪt/.","k":"6729b903"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"know\"?","options":["k","n","o","w"],"answer":0,"exp":"Know dibaca /noʊ/.","k":"ccdc6ff5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang TIDAK memiliki huruf diam?","options":["sit","knee","wrong","comb"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sit dibaca semua hurufnya.","k":"4d17743d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berima dengan \"through\"?","options":["blue","tough","though","thought"],"answer":0,"exp":"Through /θru/ berima dengan blue.","k":"02fbc6f8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berima dengan \"tough\"?","options":["enough","though","through","cough"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tough /tʌf/, enough /ɪˈnʌf/.","k":"f9fea729"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berima dengan \"though\"?","options":["go","tough","through","cough"],"answer":0,"exp":"Though /ðoʊ/, go /goʊ/.","k":"6cce51a7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berima dengan \"cough\"?","options":["off","tough","though","through"],"answer":0,"exp":"Cough /kɔf/, off /ɔf/.","k":"f87cdcd1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berima dengan \"thought\"?","options":["bought","tough","though","through"],"answer":0,"exp":"Thought /θɔt/, bought /bɔt/.","k":"c8ddc72b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf c pada \"city\" dibaca...","options":["/s/","/k/","/tʃ/","/ʃ/"],"answer":0,"exp":"C sebelum i dibaca /s/.","k":"eec819e2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf c pada \"cold\" dibaca...","options":["/k/","/s/","/tʃ/","/ʃ/"],"answer":0,"exp":"C sebelum o dibaca /k/.","k":"db2df302"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf g pada \"giant\" dibaca...","options":["/dʒ/","/g/","/ŋ/","/h/"],"answer":0,"exp":"G sebelum i sering /dʒ/.","k":"2e247a3b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf g pada \"go\" dibaca...","options":["/g/","/dʒ/","/ŋ/","/h/"],"answer":0,"exp":"G sebelum o dibaca /g/.","k":"8f853f5c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang ch-nya dibaca /k/?","options":["school","church","cheese","chef"],"answer":0,"exp":"School /skul/.","k":"8508588f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang ch-nya dibaca /ʃ/?","options":["chef","church","school","cheese"],"answer":0,"exp":"Chef /ʃɛf/. Jawaban yang tepat: **chef**.","k":"517e4c8e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang ea-nya dibaca /ɛ/?","options":["bread","eat","sea","great"],"answer":0,"exp":"Bread /brɛd/.","k":"fa055629"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang ea-nya dibaca /eɪ/?","options":["great","bread","eat","head"],"answer":0,"exp":"Great /greɪt/.","k":"6d1e01f9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang oo-nya dibaca /ʊ/ pendek?","options":["book","food","moon","blue"],"answer":0,"exp":"Book /bʊk/. Jawaban yang tepat: **book**.","k":"c16dd9ec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"write\"?","options":["right","wrote","writ","ride"],"answer":0,"exp":"Write dan right = /raɪt/.","k":"15fca9ab"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"sea\"?","options":["see","say","sew","sue"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sea dan see = /si/.","k":"86c7ff69"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"hour\"?","options":["our","or","hair","her"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hour dan our = /aʊr/.","k":"1d112f86"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"son\"?","options":["sun","sin","soon","sane"],"answer":0,"exp":"Son dan sun = /sʌn/.","k":"ea9f4b18"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"week\"?","options":["weak","wake","work","wick"],"answer":0,"exp":"Week dan weak = /wik/.","k":"68533236"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"meat\"?","options":["meet","mate","met","mit"],"answer":0,"exp":"Meat dan meet = /mit/.","k":"8e8f5d0a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih ejaan yang tepat: \"Turn ___ at the corner.\"","options":["right","write","rite","wright"],"answer":0,"exp":"Right = kanan.","k":"93a8e000"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih ejaan yang tepat: \"I can ___ you clearly.\"","options":["hear","here","hair","hare"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hear = mendengar.","k":"792d7125"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih ejaan yang tepat: \"Please ___ your name here.\"","options":["write","right","rite","wright"],"answer":0,"exp":"Write = menulis.","k":"9b422e85"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"I know the right answer.","answer":"I know the right answer.","exp":"Kalimatnya: I know the right answer. Artinya: Aku tahu jawaban yang benar.","k":"b6b6d70a"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"We walked by the sea for an hour.","answer":"We walked by the sea for an hour.","exp":"Kalimatnya: We walked by the sea for an hour. Artinya: Kami berjalan di tepi laut selama satu jam.","k":"54d10150"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"He thought the test was tough.","answer":"He thought the test was tough.","exp":"Kalimatnya: He thought the test was tough. Artinya: Dia mengira ujiannya sulit.","k":"156a23ba"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"Please listen to the radio tonight.","answer":"Please listen to the radio tonight.","exp":"Kalimatnya: Please listen to the radio tonight. Artinya: Tolong dengarkan radio malam ini.","k":"05df1ac9"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"knee\"?","options":["k","n","e","y"],"answer":0,"exp":"Knee dibaca /ni/.","k":"d18bdd4c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"talk\"?","options":["l","t","a","k"],"answer":0,"exp":"Talk dibaca /tɔk/.","k":"12b824b7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf mana yang DIAM pada \"wrong\"?","options":["w","r","o","g"],"answer":0,"exp":"Wrong dibaca /rɔŋ/.","k":"ac80f745"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berima dengan \"enough\"?","options":["tough","though","through","thought"],"answer":0,"exp":"Enough dan tough berakhir /ʌf/.","k":"6e6a29a9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Huruf c pada \"centre\" dibaca...","options":["/s/","/k/","/tʃ/","/ʃ/"],"answer":0,"exp":"C sebelum e = /s/.","k":"003c4447"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang ch-nya dibaca /tʃ/?","options":["church","school","chef","chemistry"],"answer":0,"exp":"Church /tʃɜrtʃ/.","k":"dfb092f0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang berbunyi sama dengan \"buy\"?","options":["by","bay","boy","bee"],"answer":0,"exp":"Buy dan by = /baɪ/.","k":"e26062ef"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih ejaan yang tepat: \"Come ___.\"","options":["here","hear","hair","heir"],"answer":0,"exp":"Here = di sini.","k":"b1cdd57d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih ejaan yang tepat: \"I feel ___ today.\"","options":["weak","week","wick","wake"],"answer":0,"exp":"Weak = lemah.","k":"83b6bdbc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang ea-nya dibaca /i/?","options":["eat","bread","great","head"],"answer":0,"exp":"Eat /it/. Jawaban yang tepat: **eat**.","k":"6a891b89"}],"read":[{"title":"A Night by the Sea","focus":"Ejaan","text":"We stayed at a small hotel by the sea. At night, we listened to the waves and watched the stars. My brother knew the name of every star. I wrote a few words in my notebook, and I thought it was the best night of my life.","id":"Kami menginap di hotel kecil di tepi laut. Pada malam hari, kami mendengarkan ombak dan memandang bintang. Kakakku tahu nama setiap bintang. Aku menulis beberapa kata di buku catatanku, dan kupikir itu malam terbaik dalam hidupku.","qs":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Where did they stay?","options":["At a small hotel by the sea","In a tent","At home","In a big city"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hotel kecil di tepi laut."},{"type":"mcq","q":"What did the brother know?","options":["The names of the stars","The way home","The hotel owner","The weather"],"answer":0,"exp":"Nama bintang."},{"type":"mcq","q":"What did the writer do?","options":["Wrote words in a notebook","Went swimming","Called a friend","Cooked dinner"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menulis di buku."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami mendengarkan ombak.","q":"We ___ to the waves.","answers":["listened"],"hint":"l _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"Huruf t diam pada listen."},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku menulis beberapa kata.","q":"I ___ a few words.","answers":["wrote"],"hint":"w _ _ _ _","exp":"Wrote /roʊt/, w diam."}]}]}